# Toy castle stair (ticket 27.7): sixteen step blocks of 0.3 m rise and 0.6 m tread, 2.4 m wide, its outer edge into the wall, climbing towards +z from the origin (the low end, on y = 0, at the
# middle of the stair's width) to 4.8 m at z = 9.6, then a landing to z = 10.8 level with the walk (5 m). The layout stands it against the inside of a side wall, turned to climb along it and mirrored for the other side;
# its top step is 20 cm under the wall-walk (5 m) and meets the wall's inner face, so the walk is stepped onto from the side. Each step is a solid block to the ground,
# beech and cream in turn.
format 1
collider mesh lod=0
Detail detail=0.25
    Union
        Material material=toy_beech
            Union
                Translate translation=(0, 0.15, 0.3)
                    RoundBox size=(1.2, 0.15, 0.3) roundness=0.04
                Translate translation=(0, 0.45, 1.5)
                    RoundBox size=(1.2, 0.45, 0.3) roundness=0.04
